{"id":"n14083-1-10","stage":3,"title":"영양 · 营养","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14083-1-10-1","ko":"얼마 전부터 몸이 안 좋았다면서, 병원에서는 뭐라고 해?","zh":"听说你从不久前身体就不舒服了，医院是怎么说的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"얼마","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마：多少","readings":[{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29750","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}},{"text":"전부터","meaning":"上","explanation":"전：上；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17306","senseId":"2","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전부터","audio":"/audio/5e420a07386f253866f5.mp3"}},{"text":"몸이","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몸이","audio":"/audio/5a8fb4d5acf8e6fe3214.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"좋았다면서,","meaning":"好，良好","explanation":"좋다：好，良好；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다면서：引用所听到的内容，连接后文的评论、确认或对照。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"4","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋았다면서","audio":"/audio/75ad888efbd3ccf09023.mp3"}},{"text":"병원에서는","meaning":"医院","explanation":"병원：医院；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"병원","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62271","senseId":"1","lemma":"병원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"병원에서는","audio":"/audio/02d27f24c8a673fc681f.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐라고","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐라고","audio":"/audio/95d23f1968b7f0de1b5c.mp3"}},{"text":"해?","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8e0a4529e0c9d4ed","term":"얼마","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3","entryId":"29750","definition":"未确定的数量、价值、程度。","pronunciation":["얼마"]},{"id":"d9f427c3257e81e0","term":"전","zh":"上","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3","entryId":"17306","definition":"时间上之前的。","pronunciation":["전"]},{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，良好","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"身体条件或健康状态等高于一般人。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"4f4c2d79c47ca512","term":"병원","zh":"医院","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3","entryId":"62271","definition":"具备相关设施、由医生和护士治疗病人的地方。","pronunciation":["병ː원"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ec42bc6b33215f2c92e0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14083-1-10-2","ko":"영양이 부족해서 그렇대.","zh":"说是营养不足导致的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"영양이","meaning":"营养","explanation":"영양：营养；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"영양","audio":"/audio/a4776709216a17d7e607.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14083","senseId":"1","lemma":"영양","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영양이","audio":"/audio/e65ecc0b92bd8299ad02.mp3"}},{"text":"부족해서","meaning":"不足，缺乏，不够，欠缺","explanation":"부족하다：不足，缺乏，不够，欠缺；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"부족하다","audio":"/audio/3dd9c5f65c6da41a8a1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59849","senseId":"1","lemma":"부족하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부족해서","audio":"/audio/3c5164642e5d40f5f97b.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇대.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇대","audio":"/audio/d3afe73a2d84ba282231.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a4776709216a17d7","term":"영양","zh":"营养","audio":"/audio/a4776709216a17d7e607.mp3","entryId":"14083","definition":"生物活动生存时汲取必需的能量和物质来维持生命，使身体成长的作用；或指为了维持生命，使身体成长所必需的成分。","pronunciation":["영양"]},{"id":"3dd9c5f65c6da41a","term":"부족하다","zh":"不足，缺乏，不够，欠缺","audio":"/audio/3dd9c5f65c6da41a8a1c.mp3","entryId":"59849","definition":"未能达到需要的数量或基准，不充裕。","pronunciation":["부조카다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/a4775b4d6fba6cf08653.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.989,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14083","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/l